      "name": "Waiting — Rome in Silver",
      "client": {
        "link_type": "Document"
      },
      "description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A full-CGI music video for California-based electronic producer Rome in Silver's single Waiting, featuring dragonflies journeying through a nocturnal garden.",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
      ],
      "detail_description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Vinny approached fromanother after admiring their 2021 art film called \"Beautiful Disaster\". His only creative brief was to include dragonflies. The team built a narrative of dragonflies traversing a mystical garden at night, with the 3D lighting system synced directly to specific synths and vocal layers of the track. The project ran six weeks with a team of two. ",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
      ],
